  "liner": {
   "body_md": "## Setlist highlights\n\n- **Song for Layne Staley**: rare: 6 archived performances [2]\n- **Crying on Eddie Nash's Grave**: rare: 6 archived performances [2]\n- **Charlie Sheen Reaches Out to the Feds**: rare: 14 archived performances [2]\n- **Choked Out**: back after 107 archived shows (1371 days); rare: 9 archived performances [2]\n- **Wait for You**: earliest performance in the archive; legendary: the only archived performance [2]\n- **Stars Around Her**: back after 48 archived shows (896 days); rare: 5 archived performances [2]\n- **Days**: rare: 4 archived performances [2]\n- **Through This Fire**: rare: 3 archived performances [2]\n\n## The recordings\n\n- **tMG2026-08-16** (recommended): matrix (soundboard mixed with audience mics); 24 songs; 101 min [1]\n\n## Around the show\n\n- Stage talk about: No Children [1]\n\n## Tapers and lineage\n\n- **tMG2026-08-16**: taped by Kyle Kennelly & Emerald Green; transferred by Kyle Kennelly; source: SBD > PCM A10 (24/48 WAV) + FR-AV2 > DPA 4060s (Healy Onstage 48/32 WAV) [1]\n\n## Art and photos\n\n- Poster by 91.3 WYEP: [The Mountain Goats](https://www.wyep.org/wyep-pittsburgh-concert-calendar/event/the-mountain-goats-14-05-2026-13-01-45) [3]\n- Poster by Mr Smalls: [The Mountain Goats | Mr Smalls](https://mrsmalls.com/events/the-mountain-goats-3/) [4]\n- Poster by Mr Smalls: [The Mountain Goats | Mr Smalls](https://mrsmalls.com/events/the-mountain-goats-3/) [5]",
